{"on":"tile","map":"summit","x":23,"y":27}},{"id":"summit.log","type":"fixture/furniture/table","place":{"on":"tile","map":"summit","x":13,"y":4},"name":{"en":"The watchman's log","zh":"守夜人的日志"},"tags":["readable"],"props":{"text":"SUNSET, CLOUDTOP WATCH. Year 401: 19:42 at midsummer. Year 405: 19:31. Year 409: 19:12 — I have checked the glass twice. Year 411: the reports go down the mountain and nothing comes back. Last page: Found a small light asleep in the snow by the cairn, warm as a coal. It woke and asked me how old it was. I did not know what to tell it.","text_zh":"云顶观日哨·日落记录。第401年：仲夏19:42。第405年：19:31。第409年：19:12——我把沙漏查了两遍。第411年：报告送下山，再没有回音。最后一页：在石堆旁的雪里发现一点睡着的光，暖得像炭火。它醒了，问我它多大了。我不知道该怎么回答。"}},{"type":"item/clothing/cloak","name":{"en":"Watchman's Cloak","zh":"守夜人的斗篷"},"tags":["material:cloth","cloth","flammable","quality:fine"],"props":{"def":1,"level":1,"sub:critDamage":0.1,"sub:xpRate":0.08,"sub:dodge":0.02,"sub:critChance":0.03},"id":"summit~ij","place":{"on":"tile","map":"summit","x":8,"y":5}}]}